<SiteLayout title="Privacy Policy | Roofriva Demo" description="Template privacy policy for the Roofriva demonstration website."><section class="inner-hero"><div class="shell"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1></div></section><section class="prose"><div class="content-shell"><p><strong>Template notice:</strong> This policy is provided for demonstration purposes and must be reviewed for the real business, jurisdiction, analytics tools and third-party services before production launch.</p><h2>Information collected</h2><p>This demo may collect information voluntarily submitted through contact or estimate forms, such as name, email, phone, ZIP code, selected service and message content. Technical information may also be processed by the hosting platform for security and delivery.</p><h2>How information may be used</h2><p>Submitted information may be used to respond to enquiries, route service requests, maintain website security and understand basic website performance where analytics are configured.</p><h2>Cookies and third parties</h2><p>The template does not assume any optional analytics or advertising platform. If a future client adds third-party tools, this policy and any consent mechanisms must be updated accordingly.</p><h2>Retention and rights</h2><p>Retention periods and privacy rights depend on the deployed business, jurisdiction and connected services. The future site owner should publish accurate retention practices and contact instructions.</p></div></section></SiteLayout>